\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"close_class":"env_integration","comments":[{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Root cause proven per /rebar-debug (fast path): NOT gh itself. Agent harnesses on this dev host export command-scope git config via env (GIT_CONFIG_COUNT=2, GIT_CONFIG_KEY_0=safe.bareRepository, GIT_CONFIG_VALUE_0=explicit, GIT_CONFIG_KEY_1=credential.interactive, GIT_CONFIG_VALUE_1=never). The bridge harness helpers git()/bare_git() in tests/scripts/test_run_reconcile_bridge.py inherit os.environ, so the injected safe.bareRepository=explicit fails the verification call 'git -C <bare tickets-origin.git> show tickets:bridge-event.txt' with 'fatal: cannot use bare repository'. CI exports no such vars -> green. Discriminating experiment: unsetting only GIT_CONFIG_COUNT/KEY_*/VALUE_* flips all 5 matrix params to PASS on the same tree. Sibling sweep found the same class in tests/scripts/test_run_reconcile_bridge_heldout.py and tests/interfaces/facades/test_bridge_runner_install_paths_heldout.py (21 failures total on this host). Fix (test-only): scrub GIT_CONFIG_COUNT/KEY_*/VALUE_*/PARAMETERS in the harness git helpers + runner_env, pin GIT_CONFIG_GLOBAL=/dev/null + GIT_CONFIG_NOSYSTEM=1 for helper calls, and monkeypatch the hostile injection into the matrix test so the regression is deterministic in CI. RED: strengthened matrix test fails against unfixed harness in a clean env. GREEN: 45 tests pass across all 4 bridge files on this hostile host. Mutation check: symlinking gh into fake_bin still fails the test (gh hold-out contract intact). Gates: make lint PASS, make typecheck PASS, complexity ratchet new=0 increased=0. Pushed as Gerrit change 2150 (commit 71598c097c).","timestamp":1787463651801061001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"MERGED: Gerrit change 2150 (LLM-Review +1, Verified +1, CI run 32620930449 SUCCESS incl. macOS + 3 Linux pytest matrices) submitted; landed on main as 2d9aec73fddadc62123cd2e256c4ec025b5ef198 (server-side rebase of 71598c097c). All ACs verified and ticked. caused_by: 8b08-e4d7-8dca-4aa6 (commit 694cf894de 'feat: add portable scheduled bridge runner' introduced the harness git()/bare_git() helpers that inherit os.environ without holding out ambient command-scope git-config injection).","timestamp":1787466399558187001}],"completion_expectation":"required","created_at":1787448787741111001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"9aa9c911-d204-4017-8759-209e96c2be92","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"a3f5-5c19-faad-417b"},{"link_uuid":"f761849a-2109-4349-a1a7-1b56ecde7c78","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"c1b4-18de-afd4-46d3"},{"link_uuid":"303dbc65-0cf7-4616-b3ef-0fb57237771a","provenance":"explicit","relation":"caused_by","target_id":"8b08-e4d7-8dca-4aa6"}],"description":"Observed while fixing a3f5-5c19-faad-417b (2026-08-22): on a clean origin/main checkout (8481a057b69, and reconfirmed with no local diff) on a macOS dev host, tests/unit/workflow/test_bridge_provider_wrappers_heldout.py::test_five_environment_matrix_has_identical_results_without_gh fails for all 5 params (local/github/jenkins/gitlab/bare vendor envs) while 6 other tests in the file pass and CI's Verified gate is green on the same tree.\n\nROOT CAUSE (proven per /rebar-debug): not gh itself — agent harnesses on dev hosts export command-scope git config through the environment (GIT_CONFIG_COUNT=2, GIT_CONFIG_KEY_0=safe.bareRepository, GIT_CONFIG_VALUE_0=explicit, GIT_CONFIG_KEY_1=credential.interactive, GIT_CONFIG_VALUE_1=never). The bridge harness helpers `git()`/`bare_git()` in tests/scripts/test_run_reconcile_bridge.py inherit os.environ wholesale, so the injected safe.bareRepository=explicit makes the verification call `git -C <bare tickets-origin.git> show ...` fail with \"fatal: cannot use bare repository ... (safe.bareRepository is 'explicit')\". CI has no such env vars, so it stays green. Discriminating experiment: unsetting only GIT_CONFIG_COUNT/KEY_*/VALUE_* makes all 5 params pass on the same tree. The same gap breaks tests/scripts/test_run_reconcile_bridge_heldout.py and tests/interfaces/facades/test_bridge_runner_install_paths_heldout.py (21 failures total) on such hosts.\n\nPLAN (test-only):\n1. In the shared harness tests/scripts/test_run_reconcile_bridge.py, add a scrub of ambient command-scope git-config injection (GIT_CONFIG_COUNT/GIT_CONFIG_KEY_*/GIT_CONFIG_VALUE_*/GIT_CONFIG_PARAMETERS) and pin GIT_CONFIG_GLOBAL=/dev/null + GIT_CONFIG_NOSYSTEM=1 in the git()/bare_git() helpers and the workspace-setup git subprocesses; scrub the injection vars from runner_env() so the bridge run under test is also held out from ambient host git config.\n2. In test_five_environment_matrix_has_identical_results_without_gh, monkeypatch the hostile injection (GIT_CONFIG_COUNT=1, GIT_CONFIG_KEY_0=safe.bareRepository, GIT_CONFIG_VALUE_0=explicit) unconditionally, so the matrix exercises the hostile ambient state deterministically on every host including CI — strengthening the held-out contract, not weakening it (the gh PATH hold-out is untouched).\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [x] Root cause of the host-vs-CI divergence confirmed per /rebar-debug (proven: ambient GIT_CONFIG_* command-scope injection of safe.bareRepository=explicit reaching the harness's inherited-env git subprocesses; discriminating unset experiment flips all 5 params to pass).\n- [x] Test passes on a host WITH gh installed and authenticated (and with the GIT_CONFIG_* injection present) — proven by `python -m pytest tests/unit/workflow/test_bridge_provider_wrappers_heldout.py -q` locally.\n- [x] No weakening of the held-out contract (the matrix must still prove gh-independence) — mutation check: symlinking gh into the matrix fake_bin makes the test fail.\n- [x] The strengthened matrix test is RED against the unfixed harness even in a clean environment (deterministic regression coverage in CI, not just on hostile hosts).\n- [x] Sibling sweep: tests/scripts/test_run_reconcile_bridge_heldout.py and tests/interfaces/facades/test_bridge_runner_install_paths_heldout.py pass on the hostile host via the shared-harness fix.\n\n## Testing\nReproduce: run `python -m pytest tests/unit/workflow/test_bridge_provider_wrappers_heldout.py::test_five_environment_matrix_has_identical_results_without_gh -q` on a dev host with GIT_CONFIG_KEY_0=safe.bareRepository / GIT_CONFIG_VALUE_0=explicit exported (as agent harnesses do). Verify the fix with the same command plus `python -m pytest tests/scripts/test_run_reconcile_bridge.py tests/scripts/test_run_reconcile_bridge_heldout.py tests/interfaces/facades/test_bridge_runner_install_paths_heldout.py -q`; RED-determinism by reverting the harness change and re-running the matrix test in a clean env (must fail); gh-independence mutation check by adding \"gh\" to the fake_bin symlink list (must fail).","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[{"path":"tests/scripts/test_run_reconcile_bridge.py","reason":"harness env isolation: scrub ambient GIT_CONFIG_* injection from git helpers and runner env"},{"path":"tests/unit/workflow/test_bridge_provider_wrappers_heldout.py","reason":"matrix test simulates hostile ambient git-config injection deterministically"}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"last_status_env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","managed_refs":[["relates_to","c1b4-18de-afd4-46d3"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"7d13084d-43b9-4570-a526-f0b6f120d0b6","plan_review_phase":"execution","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"closed","tags":[],"ticket_id":"3eb6-6e65-539a-4be1","ticket_type":"bug","title":"bridge provider heldout matrix test fails on dev host (passes in CI)","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["f8e14a82-6fc8-42cd-945e-b55dd68d6607","bf35a750-5382-41ca-bb60-909684f0db54","9da8f960-1bfa-4446-8935-a9c6a0c451d8","be654f36-582f-4fc0-b2d0-f2e70bdb7019","11ee83e1-c2ab-42ba-a55c-275704853c92","655c45b6-3908-4853-a5d1-a3785891c142","f761849a-2109-4349-a1a7-1b56ecde7c78","31a01ea0-0db3-4c68-9750-b320e5f3ce9f","a59ec15c-eff3-47c7-93ae-f47edb87a38c","7d13084d-43b9-4570-a526-f0b6f120d0b6","912e75b1-02a2-4b82-88d9-644e3b4fe534","303dbc65-0cf7-4616-b3ef-0fb57237771a"]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1787471202209739001,"uuid":"69c4da5e-73b7-494c-958f-f2886f31a830"}